{
  "total_duration": 65.95,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_01",
      "paragraph_id": "p01",
      "text": "Imagine entering the Hunger Games and discovering that you're not competing against 23 people.",
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 5.581,
      "scene_start": 0.0,
      "scene_end": 6.681,
      "duration": 6.681
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_02",
      "paragraph_id": "p02",
      "text": "You're competing against 47.",
      "speech_start": 6.681,
      "speech_end": 8.72,
      "scene_start": 6.681,
      "scene_end": 10.02,
      "duration": 3.339
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_03",
      "paragraph_id": "p03",
      "text": "That's exactly what happens to young Haymitch Abernathy in Sunrise on the Reaping.",
      "speech_start": 10.02,
      "speech_end": 14.435,
      "scene_start": 10.02,
      "scene_end": 15.635,
      "duration": 5.615
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_04",
      "paragraph_id": "p04",
      "text": "Normally, the Capitol selects two tributes from every district: one boy and one girl.",
      "speech_start": 15.635,
      "speech_end": 20.581,
      "scene_start": 15.635,
      "scene_end": 21.681,
      "duration": 6.046
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_05",
      "paragraph_id": "p05",
      "text": "With 12 districts, that makes 24 tributes.",
      "speech_start": 21.681,
      "speech_end": 24.454,
      "scene_start": 21.681,
      "scene_end": 25.854,
      "duration": 4.173
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_06",
      "paragraph_id": "p06",
      "text": "But Haymitch is competing in something called the Second Quarter Quell.",
      "speech_start": 25.854,
      "speech_end": 29.478,
      "scene_start": 25.854,
      "scene_end": 30.478,
      "duration": 4.624
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_07",
      "paragraph_id": "p07",
      "text": "And the Capitol changes the rules.",
      "speech_start": 30.478,
      "speech_end": 32.571,
      "scene_start": 30.478,
      "scene_end": 33.671,
      "duration": 3.194
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_08",
      "paragraph_id": "p08",
      "text": "Instead of two tributes per district, it demands four.",
      "speech_start": 33.671,
      "speech_end": 36.772,
      "scene_start": 33.671,
      "scene_end": 37.872,
      "duration": 4.201
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_09",
      "paragraph_id": "p09",
      "text": "Two boys. Two girls.",
      "speech_start": 37.872,
      "speech_end": 39.332,
      "scene_start": 37.872,
      "scene_end": 40.532,
      "duration": 2.66
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_10",
      "paragraph_id": "p10",
      "text": "Now do the math.",
      "speech_start": 40.532,
      "speech_end": 41.68,
      "scene_start": 40.532,
      "scene_end": 43.08,
      "duration": 2.547
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_11",
      "paragraph_id": "p11",
      "text": "12 districts multiplied by four tributes gives you 48 children entering the arena.",
      "speech_start": 43.08,
      "speech_end": 48.026,
      "scene_start": 43.08,
      "scene_end": 49.226,
      "duration": 6.146
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_12",
      "paragraph_id": "p12",
      "text": "That's twice the usual number.",
      "speech_start": 49.226,
      "speech_end": 51.008,
      "scene_start": 49.226,
      "scene_end": 52.308,
      "duration": 3.082
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_13",
      "paragraph_id": "p13",
      "text": "And Haymitch isn't just fighting to survive against the other tributes.",
      "speech_start": 52.308,
      "speech_end": 55.828,
      "scene_start": 52.308,
      "scene_end": 57.028,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_14",
      "paragraph_id": "p14",
      "text": "He's entering a game where the Capitol has deliberately made survival even harder.",
      "speech_start": 57.028,
      "speech_end": 61.759,
      "scene_start": 57.028,
      "scene_end": 63.059,
      "duration": 6.032
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_15",
      "paragraph_id": "p15",
      "text": "That's what makes the 50th Hunger Games so brutal.",
      "speech_start": 63.059,
      "speech_end": 65.95,
      "scene_start": 63.059,
      "scene_end": 65.95,
      "duration": 2.891
    }
  ]
}